<title>USA: USDA delays date for annual dairy products report.</title>
<headline>USDA delays date for annual dairy products report.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said Friday it had postponed release of its annual dairy products summary to Monday.</p>
<p>The report was scheduled for release later Friday. It was postponed due to computer problems, USDA said.</p>
</text>
